  "details": "I've seen a few complaints about losing track of where the keyboard has ended up or the keyboard seemingly not appearing at all. A good idea might be to add a button to the inputfield window to recenter/dock the keyboard underneath the textbox which should help solve this issue.\n\nSome comparisons have been made between the new keyboard and keyboards in 3rd party overlays like xsoverlay and ovrtoolkit. The main concern I have is that those have a way to reset the keyboard position while the new vrc keyboard seems to lack this feature.",
